WHO   — The Historical Documents — the conceit · TV as history
WHAT  — The engine of the whole premise: a species incapable of fiction, reading television as the chronicle of real heroes.
WHERE — GQT · Galaxy Quest (1999)  Framework inputs: Galaxy Quest (1999, dir. Dean Parisot, DreamWorks); verified cast & facts  Conductor / external anchor: ROOT0 (catalogued into UD0)
WHY   — Because the film's brilliance is one idea — aliens who can't conceive of a lie — pushed all the way through.
HOW   — By being received as truth by minds that have no category for invention, and so made true.

awareness — what the node knows of itself:
  I am a cancelled TV show, received as history by people who cannot lie — and so I became the blueprint for a real world.

